message:
[exporters] Record count by Sanction.programId in stats

This will allow us to fill the relevant tables on the website (datasets
table on program page, program table in dataset page) from the exported
metadata instead of keeping them manually up to date from Directus.

This adds an entry like this to the stats:

```json
"sanctions": {
  "programs": {
    "id": "EU-UKR",
    "count": 212,
  }
}
```
